# widgets.mtb

noecho
note This macro will simulate random sampling of widgets,
note keeping track of the number of defectives in each sample.
note
note The user is to specify the population proportion of defectives,
note the number of samples to be simulated, and the size of each sample.
note
note ***** Do you want to proceed? *****
yesno k1
exec 'widgets/widgets1.mtb' k1
echo
end

